      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.6823809523809525,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceCharacter" : "隠岐奈",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 5.6059637188208615,
      "id" : "C65A0C4D-502B-443E-84B3-92EBA8B0848F",
      "telop" : "「おそらく、例の彼本人かと…、どうしましょう、例の彼がいる班の班長に、何があったのかを聞き出しますか？」",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_美鈴.wav",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #40",
      "title" : "シーン 40",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "美鈴",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4",
      "voiceDuration" : 5.005963718820862,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceCharacter" : "美鈴",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 7.016666666666667,
      "id" : "99F8F133-30E1-4253-82EA-85BF5D8C2B76",
      "telop" : "「確か、あの班の班長は、パチュリーが使っている研究室で学んでいる大学院生だったよな…？」",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_隠岐奈.wav",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #41",
      "title" : "シーン 41",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "隠岐奈",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.416666666666667,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceCharacter" : "隠岐奈",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 3.5,
      "id" : "03A4D80A-0F1B-4AEA-B453-5700C8D48798",
      "telop" : "「ええ、班長の名前はアリス・マーガトロイドですが…？」",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_美鈴.wav",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #42",
      "title" : "シーン 42",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "美鈴",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.137573696145125,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceCharacter" : "美鈴",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 9.342290249433105,
      "id" : "6D678E48-55FD-43D0-A6AF-EFC34C793FF4",
      "telop" : "「なら、パチュリーに言いつけて、確認させて、あなたがその内容を聞いて、私に報告しなさい、期限は今日の午後3時までだ。」",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_隠岐奈.wav",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #43",
      "title" : "シーン 43",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "隠岐奈",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.742290249433106,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceCharacter" : "隠岐奈",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 3.5,
      "id" : "B7261EE3-AA1A-441A-A96E-6BFA1E9D0B54",
      "telop" : "「承知しました…聞き出してきます。」",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_美鈴.wav",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #44",
      "title" : "シーン 44",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "美鈴",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4",
      "voiceDuration" : 1.5932199546485262,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceCharacter" : "美鈴",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 9.777687074829931,
      "id" : "81F9DA23-E274-4D4D-BF60-0946A9EF07A7",
      "telop" : "私は、彼女が去ると、手元の机からある書類を取り出す。それには、例の彼が遠足後に受ける、試験の詳細が記されていた。",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_隠岐奈.wav",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #45",
      "title" : "シーン 45",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "隠岐奈",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88",
      "voiceDuration" : 9.177687074829931,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceCharacter" : "隠岐奈",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 2.5,
      "id" : "B06CAA8B-B273-4C2E-BBD5-A9AEA7CF8D12",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "それから、彼らは…",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #46",
      "title" : "シーン 46",
      "characterName" : "ナレーション",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationDuration" : 1.5,
      "animationNote" : "表示時間：1.5秒",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "duration" : 9.762607709750567,
      "id" : "C58EE124-9EF8-4A4D-B054-927057BC4408",
      "telop" : "それから、僕たちは、ホテルに着くと、予約した四人部屋に入る。そして、入浴の順番を決めて、アリスが先に浴室に入る。",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
